vo", "definition": "of or like nails, iron that scales off from nails, Dsc.5.78, Aët.2.58"}, "ἦλον": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "= or Seleuc. ap. Ath.2.50a"}, "ἧμα": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "that which is thrown, dart"}, "ἥμων": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "thrower, darter, Il.23.886"}, "ἦνοψ": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "perh. gleaming, Il.16.408, 18.349, Od.10.360; Call.Fr.anon.24; ib.28"}, "ἠοῖος": {"pos": "aggettivo", "definition": "Ion. Dor. = of the; toward the dawn, eastern, Od.8.29; Hdt.4.100; ib.160; towards the East, Call.Del.280"}, "ἠόνιος": {"pos": "aggettivo", "definition": "contr. from on the shore, AP7.383 ; ib.365"}, "ἠπύτα": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "Ep. for , calling, crying, the loud-voiced herald, Il.7.384; the shrill pipe, Q.S.6.170; Opp.C.2.136"}, "ἥρυς": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "or fem. of Glotta 15.306"}, "ἦτορ": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "Ep. and Lyr. word, always in nom. or acc.; exc. dat. Simon.37.6 codd. Ath.:-heart. my heart beats up to my throat, Il.22.452; the seat of life, life, 5.250, etc.; 21.114, etc.; 13.84; Q.S.1.257 : most freq., as the se…"}, "ἦτρον": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "abdomen, esp. the lower part of it; pith of a reed, Nic.Th.595"}, "ἦχος": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "later form of Arist.Aud.804a30; echo, Arist.Pr.899b30"}, "ἡβάσκω": {"pos": "verbo", "definition": "Incept. of come to puberty, Hp.Aph.3.28; metaph., E.Alc.1085; AP6.30 ; Philostr.Her.Praef"}, "ἡβάω": {"pos": "verbo", "definition": "Cret. Leg.Gort.7.41,al., Aeol; to be in the prime of youth, Od.14.468, al.; not even in the prime of life, Il.12.382, cf. Od.23.187, A.Ch.879; Id.Th.622; to be young and strong, E.HF436 ; I was young, Ar.V.357; of an …"}, "ἡγεμονεύω": {"pos": "verbo", "definition": "Dor. lead the way; dat. pers., Od.3.386, 8.4, Hes.Th.387, etc.; . . Il.15.46; to lead the way, Od.6.261, cf. Parm.1.5: twice in Hom., c. dat. et acc., Od.24.225; make a course for the water, Il.21.258"}, "ἡγέομαι": {"pos": "verbo", "definition": "Dor. (irreg. pres. part; with added, to go before on the way, Od.10.263; Hdt.9.15"}, "ἠγερέθομαι": {"pos": "verbo", "definition": "Ep. form of gather together, assemble, only 3pl. pres. and impf., and inf., . . Il.3.231, cf. h.Ap.147; Il.23.233; Od.2.392; . . 11.228; Il.10.127 Aristarch. : subj. Opp.H.3.360"}, "ἡγηλάζω": {"pos": "verbo", "definition": "Ep. collat. form of guide, lead, Od.17.217; but lead a wretched life, 11.618; A.R.1.272; Orac. ap. Zos.1.57: for Arat.893, v"}, "ἡγητήρ": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "the pilot-fish, Opp.H.5.70"}, "ἥδομαι": {"pos": "verbo", "definition": "Boeot. Corinn. in BKT5.34; with part., Od. l. c.; he was glad to have heard, Hdt.3.34; . . A.Pr.758, cf. S.Ph.882; Id.Aj.1085; . . Id.El.1325; Ar.Ach.635, etc"}, "ἡδύοινος": {"pos": "aggettivo", "definition": "Dor. producing sweet wine; containing sweet wine, Apolloph.6"}, "ἠερέθομαι": {"pos": "verbo", "definition": "Ep. for only in 3pl. pres. and impf., hang floating or waving in the air, . . , . . Il.2.448; of a flight of locusts, 21.12; of flying-fish, Opp.H.1.435; A.R.1.944: metaph., young men's minds turn with every wind, Il.…"}, "ἤθημα": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "that which is sifted or strained, Dieuch. ap. Orib.4.7.26"}, "ἠθοποιέω": {"pos": "verbo", "definition": "mould the character of a person; express or delineate character, D.H.Lys.19: c. acc., Aps.p.322 H"}, "ἤθω": {"pos": "verbo", "definition": "collat. form of , aor. 1 Hp. ap. Gal.19.103"}, "ἥκω": {"pos": "verbo", "definition": "Il.5.478: impf. : fut. (v; to have reached a point, ib.1030; E.Andr.170; Pl.Ap.25e; Id.Chrm.157d, etc.; S.OT1492; ib.687, etc.; Geom., pass through a point, Autol.Sph.10, cf. Archim.Con.Sph.9"}, "ἠλαίνω": {"pos": "verbo", "definition": "Ep. for wander, stray, flit about, Theoc.7.23 : metaph., wander in mind, Call.Dian.251"}, "ἠλασκάζω": {"pos": "verbo", "definition": "lengthd. form of; shun, flee from, c. acc., Od.9.457"}, "ἠλάσκω": {"pos": "verbo", "definition": "Ep. form of , wander, stray, roam, Il.13.104; 2.470; of persons, Emp.121.4, D.P.675"}, "ἡλιάω": {"pos": "verbo", "definition": "to be like the sun; Act., expose to the sun, Arist.Pr.926b38"}, "ἡλιόβολος": {"pos": "aggettivo", "definition": "exposed to the sun, sunny, of places, Thphr.CP4.12.3"}, "ἡλιόομαι": {"pos": "verbo", "definition": "Pass., live in the sun, be exposed to the; to be sun-struck, Hp.Aër.3; or sunburnt, Muson.Fr.19p.107H"}, "ἡλιών": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "month at Termessus, Lanckoroński Städte Pamphyliens und Pisidiens2.34"}, "ἡλιωτέος": {"pos": "aggettivo", "definition": "needing exposure to the sun, Philostr.Gym.58"}, "ἡλιώτης": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "Ion. name for the dawn, EM440.55"}, "ἡλοκοπέω": {"pos": "verbo", "definition": "= Lat. clavo, Dosith.p.435K., Gloss.; hob-nailed shoes, Gal.13.326"}, "ἡλόω": {"pos": "verbo", "definition": "Pass., become callous, Gal.17.902"}, "ἠλυγάζω": {"pos": "verbo", "definition": "overshadow, only in compd"}, "ἧμαι": {"pos": "verbo", "definition": "E.Alc. , h.Ap.456, Call.Fr.122, Ep. Il.10.100, 3.134 ; imper. Hom., A.Pr.916; subj. and opt. only in compd. inf. part. impf. , dual , pl. , Cratin.142, Ep. Il.7.61, ib.414, Hdt.8.73 : 'sits'; aspirate borrowed from Ep…"}, "ἡμέριος": {"pos": "aggettivo", "definition": "Dor. used by Trag. in lyr; daily, Ph.1.92 .—Poet. Adj., for in X.Oec.21.3 should be read"}, "ἠμί": {"pos": "verbo", "definition": "I say, the 1st pers. of pres. being; impf. 3sg. , he spake and . . , Il.1.219, etc.; . . 3.355, etc.; rarely with the subject expressed, 6.390, cf. Theoc.22.75: freq. in Att. in the phrases said I, Pl.R.327c, etc.; sa…"}, "ἡμι": {"pos": "verbo", "definition": "insep. Prefix, used in compos., half-"}, "ἡμιάστατον": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "the half-indefinite, a figure of speech expressing certainty as to the genus but doubt as to the species , Sacerd.p.469K"}, "ἡμιεπές": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "half-hexameter, Mar. Vict.p.73K., Sacerd.p.544K"}, "ἡμίοπος": {"pos": "aggettivo", "definition": "with half its holes"}, "ἡμίσχετος": {"pos": "aggettivo", "definition": "half-related , Olymp.in Phd.p.19N.; Dam.Pr.131. Adv. ibid"}, "ἡμίφι": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "𝈃, a musical note, Gaud.Harm.21, 22"}, "ἡμιχώνη": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "Kretschmer Griech.Vaseninschr.p.143"}, "ἠμύω": {"pos": "verbo", "definition": "aor. : pf. part; trans., cause to fall, ruin, Musae.Fr.22. , but ib.7.715 ; cf"}, "ἡνιοχεύω": {"pos": "verbo", "definition": "Dor. poet. form of act as charioteer, Il.11.103, cf. 23.641, Od.6.319: metaph., direct, guide, . . Alex.Aet.2: c. gen., Anacr.4: c. acc., IG3.82a"}, "ἡπατίζω": {"pos": "verbo", "definition": "to be liver-coloured, Dsc.3.22; suffer from hepatic dropsy, Diocl.Fr.46"}, "ἠπεροπεύω": {"pos": "verbo", "definition": "Ep. Verb, used only in pres. and impf., cheat, cajole: c. acc. pers., esp. of seduction, Il.5.349; Od.15.421; so of Aphrodite, Il.3.399: generally, 23.605, Od.14.400, 15.419; 13.327, Hes.Op.55"}, "ἠπεροπηΐς": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "pecul. fem. of cheating arts, [Hom.] ap. Str.1.2.4, etc"}, "ἠπύω": {"pos": "verbo", "definition": "Dor. and Arc. IG5.6.3 (Tegea, iv; abs., of the wind, roar, Il.14.399; of the lyre, sound, Od.17.271; sing, Pi.O.5.19: c.acc. cogn., Mosch.2.124"}, "ἤρεμος": {"pos": "aggettivo", "definition": "later form for quiet; smoothness, of pigments, Thphr.Lap.62"}, "ἤρυγγος": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "eryngo, Eryngium creticum, Id.Th.645,849; goat's beard, Arist.HA610b29"}, "ἥρῳ": {"pos": "verbo", "definition": "poet. dat. sg. of gen. and acc. of same"}, "ἡρωίζω": {"pos": "verbo", "definition": "write heroic verse or an epic poem, Eust.4.1"}, "ἡρωογονία": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "a poem of Hesiod, Procl.Vit.Hes.p.8G"}, "ἡσυχία": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "Ion. Dor. , rest; silence, stillness, E.Alc.77 ; esp. of the Pythagoreans, Luc.Vit.Auct.3"}, "ἠχέω": {"pos": "verbo", "definition": "intr., sound, ring, peal, . . Hes.Th.42; Mosch.Fr.1.4; E.Supp.72 ; of metal, Hdt.4.200; Pl.Prt.329a, cf. Men.66.4; of the grasshopper, chirp, Alc.39, Theoc.16.96; of the ears, tingle, LXX1 Ki.3.11; impers., of anecho,…"}, "ἤγουν": {"pos": "congiunzione", "definition": "Conj., that is to say, or rather, to define a word more correctly, freq. in glosses, cf. Eust.50.15, Lyd.Mens.4.23, etc.: sts. introduced into the text, . . Hp.Acut. 49 ; X.Oec.19.11: in late Prose, or at any rate, PM…"}, "ἡδέως": {"pos": "avverbio", "definition": "Adv. of v. III"}, "ἦκα": {"pos": "avverbio", "definition": "of Place or Motion, slightly, a little, a little to the left, Il.23.336; Od.20.301: hence, generally, softly, gently, 18.94, cf. 92; Il.24.508; 20.440; Od.17.254; Nic.Al.226"}, "ἤλιθα": {"pos": "avverbio", "definition": "Adv. very much, exceedingly; in vain, to no purpose, Call.Lav.Pall.124, A.R.2.283; Nic.Al.25, cf. 140"}, "ἠμέν": {"pos": "congiunzione", "definition": "Ep. Conj., correl. to , both . . and . . , Il.2.789, etc.; 5.751; sts. is added to 5.128; Od.2.268; . . . . Il.1.453: rarely folld. by or . . . . . 12.428; . . Od.8.575: more freq. by Il.15.664,670, Hes.Op.339"}, "ἡμιρρόπως": {"pos": "avverbio", "definition": "Adv. half turning the scale, i.e. lightly, gently, opp. Hp.Epid.2.1.7"}, "ἡμισάκις": {"pos": "avverbio", "definition": "Adv. half a time, Iamb.inNic.p.14P.,al.; two and a half times, Papp.556.16"}, "ἦρι": {"pos": "avverbio", "definition": "Ep. Adv. early, Il.9.360; Od.20.156; 19.320; in the morning, Schwyzer789 . cf"}, "ἠΰτε": {"pos": "particella", "definition": "Ep. Particle, as, like as, Il.2.872, etc.; B.12.87; freq. in similes, Il.1.359, 2.87, etc.: after a Comp., [the cloud] appears to him while afar off very black, even as pitch, 4.277, v. Sch.; with sobs coming quicker …"}, "ἧχι": {"pos": "avverbio", "definition": "Ep. for Adv. where, Il.1.607, Call.Ap.91, etc.; D.P.176,258; Id.67"}, "ἡχοῖ": {"pos": "avverbio", "definition": "Adv., = IG7.235.16"}, "ἡχοῦ": {"pos": "avverbio", "definition": "Adv., = prob. cj. in h.Merc.400"}, "ἠῶθεν": {"pos": "avverbio", "definition": "Dor. Adv., from morn, i.e. at dawn; to-morrow morning, Od.15.506; in the morning, A.R.4.1224"}, "ἡμέρα": {"pos": "sostantivo", "definition": "ἡ ἡμέρα, ἡμέρας · giorno"}}}